<!-- The lite app is the "safe" one: none of the rights an app scanner reads as a banking trojan or spyware.
     No root or Shizuku, no SMS / MMS, no accessibility services (App lock, auto clicker, cache cleaner, cover, App watch, keyboard helper), no APK installs (ArtCraft),
     no call log, no secure settings. The pages of those tools say they are not in this build. The full app keeps all of them. -->
